ce\": \"Every card shows title + priority badge (High/Medium/Low); description and deadline render only when supplied (e.g. \\\"Organize desk\\\" has neither); blocked cards show a prerequisite warning line; completed task titles carry class \\\"line-through text-muted-foreground\\\" with muted card background, distinguishing them from active tasks.\"}]}"
